        "description": "Replaces the October 2018 directive. Scope extends to commercial banks, microfinance institutions, fintechs, payment service providers and non-bank financial institutions. Board-level cyber accountability is not delegable to IT; AI and machine learning governance is explicit for fraud detection and credit scoring; core systems and customer data must remain in Ghana, with cloud restricted to non-sensitive operations; FICSOC oversight is expanded and compliance is proportional to size and risk."
